  "statement": "Let \\(Q(x)=x^{2}+2 x+3\\), and suppose that \\(P(x)\\) is a polynomial such that\n\n\\[P(Q(x))=x^{6}+6 x^{5}+18 x^{4}+32 x^{3}+35 x^{2}+22 x+8\\]\n\nCompute \\(P(2)\\).",
